{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>特斯拉在軟件更新2026.38.3中推出了Emergency Drive Away（緊急駛離）功能，允許車主在緊急情況下不拔充電槍直接駛離超充樁，但使用代價相當高昂。</strong>特斯拉車輛正常情況下在插槍狀態下無法掛擋駛離。<strong>新功能上線後，如果車主嘗試在插槍時掛擋，觸控屏會彈出紅色警告，提示「連接超充樁時無法掛擋，激活緊急駛離功能可強制解除」。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584848.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.325530+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:04:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.047939+00:00","content_hash":"92dc6ab3b8d67a56adfa54e9af2621b9d6b71cdec522559e0b0bb3d184f159b5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}